Internet Startup Services

HIGHLIGHTS

o  Helps users plan and implement their Internet presence with three new
   offerings: Internet Planning, Server Startup, and Client Startup

o  Includes everything users need to get started on the Internet

SERVICE DESCRIPTION

Digital's Internet startup services address the need for cost effective
technical assistance to enable users to get up and running on the
fast-growing Internet.

o  Internet Planning -- Provides expert technical consulting to optimize
   users' Internet business opportunities. This service includes a review
   and analysis of how users can put the Internet to work for them; it helps
   identify potential implementation issues; and offers specific technical
   recommendations for a successful launch.

o  Internet Server Startup -- Delivers a complete Internet launch solution
   quickly and efficiently. This comprehensive service covers everything
   users need to join the World Wide Web successfully: assistance with home
   page development, installation, and announcement; access provider
   recommendations; network testing and system setup; installation of
   appropriate software; and orientation. This is available as a package
   with Internet Planning.

o  Internet Client Startup -- Sets up client connections so users can browse
   the World Wide Web. This offering includes installation of client
   software; a Windows; Windows NT; Windows for Workgroups; or UNIX browser
   (i.e. Netscape or Mosaic software); required helper applications, and
   user orientation.

BENEFITS

Users can employ the Internet to expand their market reach easily and cost
effectively. They can also take advantage of mail services and the wealth of
up-to-the-minute information -- marketing data, research materials, industry
forecasts, and competitive information -- available on the Internet.

With Digital's comprehensive set of Internet services, users enjoy "one-stop
shopping" for all their Internet connectivity needs. Digital's skilled
specialists -- who have expertise in both the commercial and technical
aspects of the Internet -- help users optimize their marketing efforts.
Using Internet Planning as the "foundation" service, users find out about
potential implementation issues -- and how to address them -- before they
ramp up.

AVAILABILITY AND ORDERING

Internet Startup Services are available now through Digital.

