DECconcentrator 900TH FDDI Concentrator

HIGHLIGHTS

o  Sixteen-port FDDI concentrator module in a single slot

o  Lowers the cost of FDDI connectivity

o  Firmware supports both dual ring and tree configurations

PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

The DECconcentrator 900TH is a 16-port FDDI concentrator providing 12 fixed
front panel Unshielded Twisted Pair (UTP) MJ (RJ45-type) ports.
Additionally, two front panel modular media connector (ModPMD) ports,
supporting either multimode fiber, single mode fiber, or UTP, and two
backplane/single slot chassis ports are provided.

The DECconcentrator 900TH comes in four models: the DEFHU-MX, which allows a
user to custom-configure the media support for the two front panel ModPMD
ports; the DEFHU-MM, preconfigured with two multimode optic ports; the
DEFHU-MS, preconfigured with two single mode ports; and the DEFHU-MU,
preconfigured with two UTP ports, providing a total of 14 front panel UTP
ports.

The ModPMD ports on the front panel and the backplane ports of the
DECconcentrator 900TH models are software configurable to support various
tree or dual ring configurations. This means that port 1 can be either an
FDDI A or M port, and port 2 can be either an FDDI B or S port, depending
upon the desired configuration. The two backplane ports have the same
capability. This flexibility allows users to purchase a single module for
either direct connection to the dual ring (A/B ports) or pure "treeing" (M/S
ports).

The DECconcentrator 900TH may be interconnected or connected to other FDDI
DEChub products (DECswitch 900EF, PEswitch 900TX, or DECconcentrator 900MX)
via the backplane ports to create either treed or dual ring FDDI networks.

BENEFITS

o  Cost effective -- DECconcentrator 900TH lowers the cost of entry for
   high-speed network connectivity solutions for clients and servers.

o  Configuration flexibility -- It's the only FDDI concentrator available
   that provided a fully SNMP manageable standalone, stackable, and
   multislot hub-based solution in one product.

o  Choices of cable media supported in one product -- ModPMDs offer the
   flexibility to specify the cable media type desired. Cable media changes
   can be done easily by users, even after initial purchase, simply by
   purchasing the appropriate modular media connector (ModPMD).

PRODUCT POSITIONING

The DECconcentrator 900TH complements the current DECconcentrator 900MX by
providing a higher density, lower cost per port FDDI connectivity solution
for UTP based configurations. UTP configurations are primarily
clients/desktops and centralized servers located in a computer center in a
facility. The DECconcentrator 900MX is ideally suited and priced for FDDI
backbone configurations.

AVAILABILITY AND ORDERING

The DECconcentrator 900TH will be available in June 1995 through Digital,
its authorized resellers, value-added resellers, OEMs, and wholesale
distributors.

The DECconcentrator 900TH requires a DEChub 900 backplane or a DEChub ONE or
DEChub ONE-MX docking station for power. The DECconcentrator 900TH V1.0
software comes preloaded in all models (DEFHU-M*). Individual ModPMDs may be
ordered to be installed in a DEFHU-MX and for the DEF1H single slot chassis.
The older DEFXS-AA single mode ModPMD option with FC/PC connections is not
supported in the DEFHU-MX.

