DECmau 900TH High Density Token Ring MAU

HIGHLIGHTS

o  24 UTP passive end station lobe ports and 2 STP active Ring-In and
   Ring-Out trunk ports

o  4 or 16 Mb per second selectable ring operating speed

o  Integral SNMP management agent supporting both in-band and out-of-band
   management

o  Autowrap and autopartitioning

PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

The DECmau 900TH controls and monitors the 24 lobe ports to insert and
de-insert stations onto and off the ring. The station ring speed can be
determined before being inserted into the ring, ensuring compatibility
between the attached station and the Token Ring network. Six of the 24 ports
support the connection of satellite MAUs. This feature allows for an
increase in the number of total stations that can be attached to the Token
Ring network through the DECmau 900TH. Additionally, these six ports support
a serial channel, which can be used to provide basic management of attached
satellite MAUs, such as turning ports on and off.

The built-in, active Shielded Twisted Pair (STP) Ring-In and Ring-Out
(RI/RO) ports are compatible with IBM type II STP wiring. These ports can be
used to daisy chain between hubs or stackable configurations, thus extending
the Token Ring network lobe across multiple wiring closets. For applications
requiring the use of multimode fiber optic RI/RO lobe extensions, the
DECrepeater 900FL must be used instead of the STP RI/RO ports on the DECmau
900TH. In this application, the DECmau 900TH and DECrepeater 900FL are
connected using either the backplane of the DEChub 900 MultiSwitch, or with
twisted pair cable in standalone stackable configurations.

As with all DEChub 900 modules, the DECmau 900TH can be installed in a
DEChub 900 MultiSwitch multislot chassis or configured as a standalone,
stackable product using the DEHUA-** single slot chassis. It is also fully
Simple Network Management Protocol (SNMP) manageable in either
configuration, both in-band and out-of-band, using HUBwatch V4.0.

BENEFITS

o  Interoperability with all Digital and industry-standard 802.5 Token Ring
   products

o  Built-in SNMP management agent at no extra cost

o  Token Ring speed detection on all ports

PRODUCT POSITIONING

The DECmau 900TH is the newest member of Digital's Token Ring family of
products, which includes the DECmau 900TL (eight-port MAU), the DECrepeater
900SL (an RI/RO repeater for STP with DB9 connectors), the DECrepeater 900TL
(two-port repeater for Unshielded Twisted Pair [UTP] using RJ45 connectors),
and the DECrepeater 900FL (two-port fiber optic repeater). The DECmau 900TH
is the solution of choice when users require a higher number of Token Ring
station connections or SNMP management.

AVAILABILITY AND ORDERING

The DECmau 900TH will be available in June 1995 through Digital, its
authorized resellers, value-added resellers, OEMs, and wholesale
distributors.

