   5.25-inch half-height devices or one full-height device

PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

The BA346-KB StorageWorks pedestal for deskside expansion applications
offers maximum capacity and performance at a low cost. Its unique design
accommodates both up to seven 3.5-inch StorageWorks devices and, through the
use of an optional fixed device sub-chassis (BA35X-AB), up to two 5.25-inch
half-height devices or one full-height 5.25-inch device.

Both 8 bit (see REV requirements at the end of this article) and newer, 16
bit devices, such as the new RZ26L-VW and RZ28-VW wide SCSI disk, can be
mixed within the BA346-KB pedestal for maximum flexibility and investment
protection.

The BA346 pedestal complements the BA350 and BA356 StorageWorks pedestals.
Consult the table in the technical data section below for more details.

BENEFITS

o  Support for both 3.5-inch and 5.25-inch devices provides greater
   investment protection and increased ability to meet user requirements.

o  Support for 5.25-inch devices without decreasing number of 3.5-inch disks
   allows users to include other devices, such as tapes and CDs, lowering
   the cost of implementing storage.

o  Support for both 8 bit and 16 bit devices ensures that users can attain
   performance benefits of new wide SCSI devices.

o  A full-width locking door provides security, yet easy device access.

o  The BA346 pedestal supports the StorageWorks fault bus for remote system
   monitoring.

AVAILABILITY AND ORDERING

