Supported software:
o  Server side databases: Oracle Rdb, RMS, Oracle7, and SYBASE SQL Server

o  Client side databases: SYBASE SQL Server, Microsoft SQL Server, Borland
   InterBase, Oracle7, X-Base file, ODBC for Oracle Rdb, Watcom/SQL, RMS,
   and DB2/400

o  Server operating systems: OpenVMS Alpha, Digital UNIX, and most competing
   UNIX platforms

o  Axiant development client: Microsoft Windows and terminals



