is listed under the installation price category and includes system
integrity check, diagnostics, personalization of UPS parameters, operator
training and replacement, or repair of any failed modules. Digital also
offers guaranteed four-hour response and fully covers the batteries,
regardless of age.

A licensed electrician is required for electrical installation, including
hardwired input or output connections. Installation should be coordinated
with Digital Service to meet serviceability requirements.

