"RUMBA" before the "*.PS".)

The Multia System Administrator Kit V3.0 provides the distribution media for
RUMBA for Mainframe for Multia software, plus a single user license.
Additional users of RUMBA for Mainframe for Multia software will need to
purchase the appropriate software option license.

BENEFITS

o  Ease of use and product quality based on "best in class" RUMBA
   technology.

o  Executable for the Multia Desktop so that the Multia Configuration
   Manager can be used to distribute the software to Multia systems across
   the enterprise without the need for local installation.

o  Equivalent terminal emulation look and feel to what is available in the
   PC version of the RUMBA for Mainframe product.

o  A 32 bit, native mode application with extraordinarily fast execution on
   an Alpha based platform.

o  Takes advantage of the Multia central desktop management that simplifies
   the user environment and results in a lower cost of operation compared to
   PCs or workstations.

AVAILABILITY AND ORDERING

RUMBA for Mainframe for Multia V3.0 is available now.

