SEE IT Alliance for CASE Solutions

HIGHLIGHTS

o  Builds, markets, and supports cost effective software development
   environments for HP, Sun, and Digital UNIX systems

o  Forum for top software development tool vendors for commercial and
   technical CASE to collaborate and respond to users' needs

o  Forges stronger, more effective relationships between the users and
   providers of systems and software engineering environments

PROGRAM DESCRIPTION

The world's leading vendors of software development tools and environments,
including Digital, have formed the SEE IT Alliance to help users overcome
the challenges of designing commercial and technical software solutions for
multivendor client/server UNIX solutions. SEE IT Alliance members offer
Computer Aided Software Engineering (CASE) tools and environments that are
used to develop safety, mission, and transaction-critical applications
within the aerospace, defense, banking, electronics, financial, medical, and
telecommunications industries.

Chartered with making the whole software engineering process more cost
effective, more predictable, and more responsive to business needs, the SEE
IT Alliance helps users develop flexible, open, and integrated software
development environments that support transparent distribution of data and
tools across client/server networks on Digital UNIX (formerly called DEC
OSF/1), HP-UX, and SunOS platforms.

Digital's COHESIONworX integration framework for development environments is
the foundation upon which integrated SEE IT solutions are built.
COHESIONworX software provides the desktop environment that enables the
complementary tools of the SEE IT Alliance partners to work together
