CASE plays an important role in nearly every industry today. Indeed, recent
studies from IDC and Dataquest estimate the current size of the technical
and commercial CASE markets to be $28 billion worldwide, with $14 billion
attributed to software, $3.5 billion to services, and $10.5 billion to
