correction (VA=watts). Users should choose UPS based on watts limitation.
Prestige 3000, 6000 (including 4500va model), and EXT models have add on,
plug in battery extention provisions. Upgradeable models include Prestige
650 through 1000, 1000 through 1500EXT, and 4500 through 6000.

